1.SPC参数监控：所有生产设定参数（速度/压力/温度/电流/真空值/时间/次数/米数/能量/照度/涨缩值/转速/张力/拉力等…）、品质监控参数（PH/电导率/泄漏量/真空度等...）均可以通信显示在人机或PC计算机上；
1.The SPC parameter monitoring: all production parameters (speed / pressure / temperature / current / value / time / frequency / vacuum meters / energy / light / /Aqua/ / value / expansion speed tension force...) The quality monitoring parameters (PH/ conductivity / leakage / vacuum etc.) can all be communicated on man-machine or PC computer ；
a.参数通过PLC上传信息服务器:由设备商提供寄存器点位/换算比/完成传输；
a.The parameters are uploaded to the information server through PLC: the device provider provides the register point / conversion ratio / complete transmission by the device dealer; 
b.参数通过PC上传信息服务器:由设备商提供抛转程序，以web service格式自动上传信息服务器（抛转频率1次/min);
b.The parameters are uploaded to the information server by PC:the device provider provides the tossing program and automatically uploads the information server in the web service format (1 times /min);

9.新机请购需要提供机械安全评估报告（组合式设备的统一有采购方进行确认提供）并符合国标安全规范要求标准（参考《GB/T5226.1机械电器安全 机械电气设备 第一部分:通用技术条件》;《机械安全 防护装置 固定式和活动式防护装置设计与制造一般要求GB/T8196-2019》,《GB23821机械安全放置上下肢触及危险区域的安全距离》）
9. For the procurement of new machinery, a mechanical safety assessment report must be provided (for modular equipment, this responsibility falls to the purchaser to confirm and supply). Additionally, the equipment must comply with national safety standards, including references to:  
- GB/T 5226.1 "Mechanical Electrical Safety – Mechanical Electrical Equipment – Part 1: General Technical Specifications";  
- GB/T 8196-2019 "Mechanical Safety – Protective Devices – General Requirements for Design and Manufacturing of Fixed and Movable Protective Devices";  
- GB 23821 "Mechanical Safety – Safety Distances for Upper and Lower Limbs When Approaching Hazardous Areas."

